        "text": "## FLUX.2 Klein 9B FP8 — Real HD 2K\n\nIn Pipeline Editor, choose the Model Package directory below. The editor links the denoiser, Qwen3-8B FP8 encoder, and FLUX.2 VAE as one package, then Run generates a 1024 × 1024 image.\n\n`~/coreai-models/exports/FLUX.2-klein-9B-fp8-1024-real-hd-2k`\n\nThis fixed 1024-pixel package uses GPU-preferred Core AI FP8 functions. The Real HD 2K adapter is already fused in its separate denoiser export; its name does not change the 1024 × 1024 output size."
